#. module: runner
#: model:res.groups,comment:runner.privilege_runner
msgid ""
"Held by a runner's service user while it serves a runner's call: it reads "
"the runner and its company's jobs, leases one, appends its events and "
"finishes it. Creating, cancelling and retrying jobs stays with the "
"administrators."
msgstr ""
"La tiene el usuario de servicio de un runner mientras atiende una llamada "
"del runner: lee el runner y los trabajos de su empresa, arrienda uno, añade "
"sus eventos y lo termina. Crear, cancelar y reintentar trabajos sigue siendo"
" de los administradores."

